    "faq_PWGiDc": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_aC4Ddy": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "About Sihoo",
            "answer": "<p>Founded with a mission to redefine the modern workspace, Sihoo is a leading global brand specializing in ergonomic furniture solutions. We design and manufacture cutting-edge ergonomic chairs and height-adjustable desks that empower professionals, gamers, designers, students, and remote workers to perform at their best—without compromising on health or comfort. With a customer-first philosophy and a dedication to research and innovation, Sihoo products are crafted with precision, tested for durability, and recognized for their outstanding ergonomic design. Our products are trusted by millions of users in over 100 countries, and we are proud recipients of international accolades including the German Design Award. Whether you're building a home office or outfitting a corporate workspace, Sihoo is your partner in creating a healthier, more productive environment.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_HzkkzH": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "About Sihoo Chairs",
            "answer": "<p>Sihoo ergonomic chairs are designed with your body in mind. Our chair lineup—including the award-winning Sihoo Doro Series—features state-of-the-art ergonomic innovations like dynamic lumbar support, anti-gravity recline mechanisms, 6D coordinated armrests, seat depth adjustment, and breathable mesh backrests. Each Sihoo chair is developed using advanced biomechanics research to support natural posture, reduce spinal pressure, and enhance comfort during long hours of sitting. Whether you're working, studying, gaming, or relaxing, Sihoo chairs adapt to your movements and provide full-body support from head to toe. With sleek aesthetics, durable materials, and customizable adjustments, Sihoo chairs are ideal for anyone seeking a balance of design, function, and wellness. Transform your workspace and invest in your health with a Sihoo chair that supports every move you make.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_mWjTHY": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "About Sihoo Desks",
            "answer": "<p>Sihoo standing desks are engineered for flexibility, stability, and long-term performance. With a strong focus on ergonomic design, our electric height-adjustable desks help you alternate between sitting and standing seamlessly, promoting better posture, reduced fatigue, and improved circulation throughout your workday. Every Sihoo desk features a solid steel frame, whisper-quiet motor technology, and intelligent features like anti-collision detection and memory height settings. Whether you're a student, a remote worker, or a professional in a dynamic office environment, Sihoo desks support your workflow with customizable height ranges and intuitive controls. From sleek modern designs to robust performance, our desks are built to accommodate every task and every body. Experience the freedom to move, focus, and thrive with a Sihoo ergonomic desk that fits your lifestyle.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "faq_item_aC4Ddy",
